[ABOUT] We are a Global Investment Firm Driven by Shared Success | KKR
We are a Global Investment Firm Driven by Shared Success | KKR The Power of Together&lt;/h1>
&lt;h6>&lt;span class=\&#34;charcoal\&#34;>A global investment firm investing across private markets in every asset class all over the world, our mission is to fortify companies and communities and help secure the futures of the institutions and individuals counting on us.&lt;br>
&lt;/span>&lt;/h6>
&lt;h6>&lt;span class=\&#34;charcoal\&#34;>We have a deep commitment to our clients and portfolio companies and believe in shared success.&lt;/span>&lt;/h6>
&#34;}}" id="text-8ab27fdc71"> The Power of Together A global investment firm investing across private markets in every asset class all over the world, our mission is to fortify companies and communities and help secure the futures of the institutions and individuals counting on us. We have a deep commitment to our clients and portfolio companies and believe in shared success. A culture defined by collective strength A culture defined by collective strength A culture defined by collective strength PLAY VIDEO In 1976, Henry Kravis and George Roberts co-founded KKR alongside their mentor Jerome Kohlberg. Today KKR is a global, with multiple types of capital that are invested all over the world on behalf of our clients, and those investments are helping address the some of the world&#39;s most pressing challenges.&lt;/p>
&#34;,&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;/content/kkr/sites/global/en/about/history&#34;,&#34;image&#34;:{&#34;repo:id&#34;:&#34;d930dc26-edb4-48bd-8f5f-3034323663ae&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-04-29T18:22:17Z&#34;,&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;image/jpeg&#34;,&#34;repo:path&#34;:&#34;/content/dam/kkr/about/about-henry-george.jpg&#34;,&#34;xdm:tags&#34;:[],&#34;xdm:smartTags&#34;:{}}}}"> 50 Years of Collaboration, Teamwork, and Partnership In 1976, Henry Kravis and George Roberts co-founded KKR alongside their mentor Jerome Kohlberg. Today KKR is a global, with multiple types of capital that are invested all over the world on behalf of our clients, and those investments are helping address the some of the world&#39;s most pressing challenges. Our History Who we serve We provide alternative asset management and capital markets solutions for a wide range of companies and clients. Institutional Investors Our differentiated investment insights, time-tested approach, and wide array of solutions help pensions, sovereign wealth funds, endowments and foundations, consultants, and insurance companies fulfill their missions. LEARN MORE Global Wealth Our Global Wealth Solutions for eligible individual investors across private equity, private credit, infrastructure, and real estate draw on an investment process honed over nearly five decades and many market cycles. LEARN MORE Family Capital Our global Family Capital team is dedicated to helping families and entrepreneurs find solutions for their unique investment needs. LEARN MORE Companies The companies we invest in benefit from more than just our capital. As trusted partners, we aim to help them achieve operational excellence and provide expertise across a variety of industries and markets. LEARN MORE invested in our own funds and portfolio companies alongside our clients.*&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>
&#34;,&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;/content/kkr/sites/global/en/approach/delivering-better-outcomes&#34;,&#34;image&#34;:{&#34;repo:id&#34;:&#34;23ece157-8283-4e0a-a1e9-a0fb5678811e&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-08-15T18:56:33Z&#34;,&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;image/jpeg&#34;,&#34;repo:path&#34;:&#34;/content/dam/kkr/about/AU-Who-We-Serve-793x462.jpg&#34;,&#34;xdm:tags&#34;:[],&#34;xdm:smartTags&#34;:{}}}}"> $ 30B invested in our own funds and portfolio companies alongside our clients.* Learn more &lt;span class=\&#34;eyebrow\&#34;>Our Values&lt;/span>&lt;/p>
&#34;}}" id="text-1e0cbb7daa"> Our Values Pursue Excellence Earn Like &amp; Trust Every Day Stay Curious, Be Creative Work Together Remember, People are Counting on Us People here like to be helpful, share experiences and use their networks to solve problems. It&#39;s a team sport.&#34; Scott Nuttall & Joseph Bae Co-Chief Executive Officers Our Operating Model – Three Engines of Growth&lt;/h2>
